        <mxCell id="GVnak-cB7Vlg1Gr9T-Ec-9" value="í ¾í·  **Pretraining**&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Learns distribution áº‘p(x)&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;â†’ inevitable error floor&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
