        <mxCell id="GVnak-cB7Vlg1Gr9T-Ec-10" value="í ½í»  **Post-training**&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;RLHF / DPO&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;â†’ incentivizes bluffing&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
