        <mxCell id="GVnak-cB7Vlg1Gr9T-Ec-11" value="í ¾í·ª **Evaluation**&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Binary benchmarks&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;reward guessing&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
